{"seq":3,"slug":"networking-layer-architecture","title":"网络层架构","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-networking-data-layer/networking-layer-architecture","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"api-client-design","title":"API 客户端设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-networking-data-layer/networking-layer-architecture/api-client-design","wordCount":1878,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"endpoints-and-routing","title":"端点与路由","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-networking-data-layer/networking-layer-architecture/endpoints-and-routing","wordCount":1777,"readingTime":8},{"seq":3,"slug":"retry-and-resilience","title":"重试与韧性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-networking-data-layer/networking-layer-architecture/retry-and-resilience","wordCount":2117,"readingTime":9}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"网络层架构-简介\">网络层架构 简介</h1><p>把 <code>URLSession</code> 调用散落在各个视图控制器里，是新手最常见的坏味道——重复的请求构建、不一致的错误处理、无法测试、改个 base URL 要改几十处。成熟的应用把网络收敛进一个<strong>有结构的网络层</strong>。本章讲清网络层架构：先是 <strong>API 客户端设计</strong>（一个集中的客户端封装请求执行、共享配置、便于注入与测试），然后是端点与路由（用类型描述每个 API 端点——路径/方法/参数/返回类型，让调用既类型安全又自文档），最后是重试与韧性（超时、重试退避、401 刷新 token、断网处理——让网络层在真实不稳定的网络下稳健）。掌握网络层架构，让网络代码可维护、可测试、可演进。</p>\n"}